{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And his father rebuked him.</b> גערה with a bet is in the mode of rebuke; without a bet it is a term of destruction, as in הנני גוער לכם את הזרע (Malachi 2:3). Or it is by way of parable, that He rebukes the seed so that it fears and does not rise:" "<b>I and your mother.</b> Referring to Bilhah, his mother's maidservant, who raised him:"], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:47:15.709338022Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}